---
/*
 * Starlight's ThemeProvider, dark first: no stored choice means dark, whatever the system says.
 * Inlined so no page paints in the wrong theme. The home page and the 404 use the same one, so
 * the choice follows the reader between them and the docs.
 */
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme =
    localStorage.getItem("starlight-theme") === "light" ? "light" : "dark";
</script>
